    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26658" root="طرق" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَقَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَقٌ</span>, in four places: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرْقٌ</span>, last quarter. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  One says also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَضَعَ الأَشْيَآءَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَقَةً طَرَقَةً</span> i. e. <i>He put the things one upon
another;</i> and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرِيقَةً طَرِيقَةً</span></b> . (TA.)

